BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bank of America Free Family Fun Day - October Spooky Critters
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261031
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261101
DTSTAMP:20261031T155152Z
UID:9a5d6b5d72918d4053a88cd104e7@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Thanks to Bank of America\, the Audubon Nature Center and Aqua
 rium is open free to the public for Free Family Fun Day one Saturday each 
 month. No need to register\, all programs are free of charge. 10:00am &#82
 11\; 3:00pm: Craft Table 10:00am &#8211\; 3:00pm: Self-Guided Jack-o-lante
 rn Hunt &#8211\; Take to the trails in search of hidden Jack-o-lanterns! 1
 0:00am-3:00pm: Spooky Critters Discovery Station &#8211\; Owls\, snakes\, 
 and bats\, oh my! Dare to discover the world of spooky critters at this ha
 nds-on discovery table! Get up close with real animal biofacts\, match the
 m to their mystery critters\, and uncover the secrets behind these creepy 
 creatures! 10:00am: Nature Story 11:00am &amp\; 2:30pm: Animal Interview 1
 :00pm: Guided Nature Walk &#8211\; Join an Audubon naturalist for a guided
  walk to explore the local habitats and look for signs of spooky critters.
 \n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/bank-of-america-free-fa
 mily-fun-day-october-spooky-critters/111933/
LOCATION:Audubon Nature Center and Aquarium\, 1401 Hopes Street\, Bristol
 \, RI\, 1401 Hopes Street\, Bristol\, 06010
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/bank-of-america-free-family-fun
 -day-october-spooky-critters/111933/
END:VEVENT
